 "open_questions": [
  "Bus input reused from the HAT (TPS2121) with its open review points: ILIM resistor sets about 3.5 A, over the JST XH's 3 A; OV1/OV2 tied to ground, so no over-voltage cut-off, and the LP5907s are rated to 5.5 V.",
  "CSI pairs and the octal bus: 100 \u03a9 differential / 50 \u03a9 single-ended impedance and length matching are not enforced by the router; the 4-layer stack-up's impedances not computed.",
  "See each new block's open questions (n6_core, n6_power, flash_mx25um, camera_fpc15).",
  "Camera placement in the 3D model (beside the board's camera socket, lens up, on a short cable) is a display choice, not a mechanical design."
 ],
